.SH "Larousse"
.SS "Introduction (motives)"
.PP
As programming using Franc C can easily become overwhelming, we decided
to provide a set of already implemented functions, in a library called
\fILarousse\fP, as a way to facilitate some tasks.

.PP
\fILarousse\fP also serves as a way to showcase our language’s capabilities,
and demonstrate its verbose syntax, and acts as a test suite for the
\fIAcadémie Franc C'Aise\fP, which runs functional tests on it.
